t-lg mb-3 group-hover:text-vc-tools transition-colors duration-200 line-clamp-2 text-vc-text">AI 应用构建器对比 2026：10 款工具功能与价格横向评测</h3><p class="text-sm text-vc-text-dim mb-4 line-clamp-2">10 款 AI 应用构建器并排对比，覆盖功能矩阵、价格、代码归属和典型使用场景。Lovable、Bolt.new、Replit、Cursor、Bubble 谁更适合你？</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div></div></a></div><div class="text-vc-text group overflow-hidden border border-vc-border-alt hover:border-vc-tools/40 hover:transition-all duration-300 bg-vc-surface"><a class="block" href="/blog/zh/ai-yingyong-goujianqi-jiage"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden border-b border-vc-border-alt bg-vc-bg aspect-[16/9] crt_crtImage__ad4cP crt_crtImageLime__7B9Cm "><img alt="AI 应用构建器价格对比 2026：免费层到企业版全解析" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fheroes%2Fai-app-builder-pricing-hero-card.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbl