:"优点和缺点","level":2},{"id":"devin-vs-其他工具","text":"Devin vs 其他工具","level":2},{"id":"适合谁","text":"适合谁","level":2},{"id":"总结","text":"总结","level":2}],"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/tools/devin\"\u003eDevin\u003c/a\u003e 是 Cognition 公司推出的全自主 AI 软件工程师。它和 \u003ca href=\"/tools/cursor\"\u003eCursor\u003c/a\u003e、Copilot 这种「副驾驶」工具有根本区别：你不是和它一起写代码，而是给它派任务，它自己规划、写代码、跑测试、调 bug、提 PR。本文实测它在 2026 年的真实表现，以及国内团队该不该上车。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"devin-是什么\"\u003eDevin 是什么\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevin 在自己的沙箱开发环境里工作，配备完整的代码编辑器、终端和浏览器。你通过聊天界面或 Slack 给它派活，过一会儿回来收 PR。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e核心区别：\u003cstrong\u003eDevin 不是增强你的编码会话，它在跑它自己的编码会话。\u003c/strong\u003e 你像派任务给初级工程师一样派任务给它：写清需求、给上下文，然后让它执行。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"核心功能\"\u003e核心功能\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"全自主执行\"\u003e全自主执行\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e派一个任务比如「给用户列表 API 加分页」，Devin 会完成整个流程：读代码库、规划实现、写代码、跑测试、调 bug、开 PR。它能在多步问题之间推理，方案失败会回退重试。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"沙箱-ide\"\u003e沙箱 IDE\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e每个 Devin 会话跑在独立的环境里，你可以实时看它工作：读哪些文件、跑什么命令、怎么调 bug。这种透明度建立信任，方向不对的时候你能及时纠偏。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"devin-wiki\"\u003eDevin Wiki\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevin 会自动生成代码库文档：架构概览、关键文件说明、依赖关系图。下次它接手新任务时上手更快，对团队也是一份活文档。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"api-集成\"\u003eAPI 集成\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e提供 API 用于程序化派任务。可以接到 CI/CD、Slack 工作流、issue tracker 上做自动化。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"价格acu-计费模式\"\u003e价格：ACU 计费模式\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevin 用 Agent Compute Units（ACU）计费，根据任务复杂度、代码库大小、会话时长消耗不等。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\" style=\"overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;margin:2.5rem 0\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"margin:0\"\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003e计划\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003e月费\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eACU 配额\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003e单位 ACU 价格\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCore\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$20/月（约 ¥144/月）+ 按用量\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e按需付费\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$2.25/ACU\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTeam\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$500/月（约 ¥3600/月）\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e含 250 ACU\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$2.00/ACU\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eEnterprise\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e联系销售\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e定制\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e定制\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e关键问题：ACU 成本不可预测。\u003c/strong\u003e 一个简单 bug 修复可能消耗 1-2 ACU；一个复杂功能可能用掉 10+ ACU。新团队头一个月要密切关注用量。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e折算下来：\u003c/p\u003e\u003c!-- NEWSLETTER_CTA --\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e一个中等任务大概 ¥30-100\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTeam 版包含 250 ACU，相当于每个任务平均 ¥14 才划算\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e月用量超过 200 ACU 才推荐升级 Team\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"国内团队能用吗\"\u003e国内团队能用吗\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e几个现实问题：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e支付\u003c/strong\u003e：需要海外信用卡或公司 Stripe 账户。个人开发者难度大，公司订阅相对容易。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e网络\u003c/strong\u003e：Devin 控制台需要稳定的海外网络访问，团队部署需要企业级 VPN。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e代码安全\u003c/strong\u003e：Devin 会读你的代码库，对涉及核心 IP 的项目要谨慎。Enterprise 版本支持 VPC 部署，但价格不公开。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e知乎和 V2EX 上的讨论里，国内用 Devin 的团队大多是出海公司或者外资分部。纯内资团队更多选择本地化方案，比如 \u003ca href=\"/blog/zh/openclaw-wanquan-anzhuang-zhinan-2026\"\u003eOpenClaw 完全安装指南\u003c/a\u003e 里讲的自托管智能体。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"优点和缺点\"\u003e优点和缺点\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e优点：\u003c/strong\u003e 真正自主、沙箱安全、可观察、Devin Wiki 自动生成代码文档、API 集成 CI/CD、无限座位。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e缺点：\u003c/strong\u003e ACU 成本不可预测、不能实时结对、需求写不清就烧 ACU、Core 计划 10 个并发上限、执行延迟从分钟到小时。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"devin-vs-其他工具\"\u003eDevin vs 其他工具\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003evs Cursor\u003c/strong\u003e：Cursor 是副驾驶 IDE，你写代码 + AI 辅助。Devin 是自主智能体，你派任务 + 审核结果。两者互补。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003evs \u003ca href=\"/tools/claude-code-cli\"\u003eClaude Code CLI\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e：\u003ca href=\"/tools/claude-code\"\u003eClaude Code\u003c/a\u003e 在终端跑、需要人在回路。Devin 在沙箱跑、完全自主。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003evs \u003ca href=\"/tools/openhands\"\u003eOpenHands\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e：OpenHands 是 Devin 的开源替代，可自托管，代价是配置复杂。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"适合谁\"\u003e适合谁\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e适合\u003c/strong\u003e：出海团队、想并行实现任务的小团队、偏好「描述需求」的 vibe coder、有成熟代码库需要持续维护的。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e不适合\u003c/strong\u003e：享受交互式编程的单兵开发者、需要实时结对的、预算紧任务量不稳定的。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"总结\"\u003e总结\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevin 代表 vibe coding 最激进的愿景：描述需求，AI 自主交付。建议先用 Core 计划摸清 ACU 基线再决定升级。国内团队如果支付和网络难解决，看看本地化方案：\u003ca href=\"/blog/zh/coding-plan-duibi-pingce-2026\"\u003eCoding Plan 对比评测\u003c/a\u003e 性价比更高。\u003c/p\u003e","seo":{"metaTitle":"Devin 评测 2026：AI 工程师真能替代初级开发吗 | vibecoding.app","metaDescription":"Devin AI 怎么样？深度测评这款全自主 AI 工程师的能力、$20/月 + $2.25/ACU 定价、与 Cursor 对比，以及国内团队访问方案。","ogImage":"/images/blog/heroes/devin-review-hero-card.jpg","keywords":["devin 评测","devin ai 工程师","devin 怎么样","ai 自主编程"],"canonicalUrl":""},"schema":null},"hreflangEnSlug":"devin-review","tool":{"id":"devin","name":"Devin (Cognition Suite)","title":"Devin: Autonomous AI Software Engineer + Desktop + CLI Suite","category":"ide-agents","mobile_capability":{"tier":"not-applicable","note":"A coding environment rather than an app builder. What reaches a store depends on the project you point it at, not on the tool."},"description":"Cognition's coding agent suite. Devin Cloud is the autonomous remote engineer (plans, codes, tests, opens PRs). Devin Desktop (formerly Windsurf, rebranded June 2026) is the local AI editor with the Agent Command Center, Spaces, and ACP support. Devin CLI brings the same agent into the terminal. All three share one Cognition account and the SWE-2 proprietary model, released September 10, 2026.","compare_clusters":["cursor","claude-code-cli","windsurf","replit-agent"],"official_links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://devin.ai"},{"label":"Devin Desktop (ex-Windsurf)","url":"https://devin.ai/desktop"},{"label":"Devin CLI","url":"https://devin.ai/cli"},{"label":"Devin Cloud","url":"https://devin.ai/cloud"},{"label":"Pricing","url":"https://devin.ai/pricing"},{"label":"Docs","url":"https://docs.devin.ai"},{"label":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devin_AI"}],"pricing":"Free $0 · Pro $20/mo · Max $200/mo · Teams $80/mo + $40/mo per full dev seat (up to 200 users) · Enterprise custom. Billed monthly only, no annual option. Paid plans carry a daily/weekly refreshing usage allowance; extra usage at API pricing.","usps":["Three surfaces: Devin Cloud (autonomous remote agent), Devin Desktop (local editor, ex-Windsurf), Devin CLI (terminal)","One Cognition account drives all three; Agent Command Center orchestrates from Desktop","SWE-2 proprietary model, free on paid plans in Desktop and CLI through October 16, 2026, plus Claude / GPT / Gemini / xAI frontier models","Devin Wiki auto-documents your codebase for faster onboarding and context sharing","API + ACP (Agent Coding Protocol) for embedding Devin into CI/CD and other editors"],"signup_url":"https://devin.ai","logo_url":"/images/tools/logos/devin-logo.png","hero_image":"/images/tools/heroes/devin-hero.jpg","votes":2394,"serpBoost":2,"dateModified":"2026-09-30","tags":["enterprise"],"seo_keywords":["devin ai review","devin autonomous coding agent","devin ai pricing 2026","ai software engineer","autonomous code generation","vibe coding agent"],"best_for_badges":["Autonomous Agent","End-to-End Tasks"],"special_features":[{"icon":"Bot","title":"Fully Autonomous Execution","description":"Devin plans, writes, tests, and deploys code end-to-end in a sandboxed environment; no hand-holding needed."},{"icon":"Terminal","title":"Sandboxed IDE + Shell","description":"Each task runs in an isolated environment with a full code editor, terminal, and browser for safe exploration and execution."},{"icon":"BookOpen","title":"Devin Wiki","description":"Auto-generated codebase documentation that helps Devin (and your team) understand the project context faster."}],"theme_colors":{"primary":"blue-600","secondary":"indigo-600","gradient":"from-blue-600 to-indigo-600"},"tweets":[{"id":"2027085000986824960","authorName":"0xMarioNawfal","authorHandle":"@RoundtableSpace","authorAvatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2012162102283407360/U-fPj6wg_400x400.jpg","content":"Devin 2.2 just dropped, it now tests its own work, catches the bugs, and fixes them without you touching anything. 3x faster, fully rebuilt interface, computer use with a virtual desktop.","date":"Feb 26, 2026","url":"https://x.com/RoundtableSpace/status/2027085000986824960"},{"id":"2025857789932023913","authorName":"Hamza Khalid","authorHandle":"@Whizz_ai","authorAvatar":"/images/avatars/fallback-du.svg","content":"The entire AI coding industry just got exposed. Someone leaked the system architecture of AI coding tools: Cursor, Devin AI, Windsurf, Claude Code, v0, Lovable, Replit, 30,000+ lines of hidden instructions.","date":"Feb 23, 2026","url":"https://x.com/Whizz_ai/status/2025857789932023913"},{"id":"2025542531086454921","authorName":"Ihtesham Ali","authorHandle":"@ihtesham2005","authorAvatar":"/images/avatars/fallback-du.svg","content":"Someone leaked the system prompts of every major AI coding assistant. You can see exactly how they work: Cursor, Claude Code, Windsurf, Devin, Replit, v0, 30,000+ lines of internal instructions and prompts.","date":"Feb 22, 2026","url":"https://x.com/ihtesham2005/status/2025542531086454921"}],"related_blog_slugs":["devin-review"],"features":{"hasAgenticMode":true,"hasCodeAutocomplete":false,"hasChatCoding":true,"hasMultiFileEditing":true,"supportedModels":"Proprietary (Cognition models)","supportsCustomModels":false,"hasImageToCode":false,"platformType":"Cloud Agent (sandboxed IDE)","isWebBased":true,"hasDesktopApp":false,"hasBuiltInDeployment":true,"deploymentTargets":"Sandboxed environment with PR submission","hasGitIntegration":true,"isOpenSource":false,"hasFreePlan":false,"paidStartsAt":"$20/mo (Core) + $2.25/ACU","isTokenBased":true,"canBuyMoreCredits":true,"creditCost":"$2.25/ACU (Core), $2/ACU (Team)","hasDailyLimits":false,"isBeginnerFriendly":false,"targetAudience":"Teams delegating full tasks to an autonomous agent"}},"ctaTool":{"id":"devin","name":"Devin (Cognition Suite)","title":"Devin: Autonomous AI Software Engineer + Desktop + CLI Suite","category":"ide-agents","mobile_capability":{"tier":"not-applicable","note":"A coding environment rather than an app builder. What reaches a store depends on the project you point it at, not on the tool."},"description":"Cognition's coding agent suite. Devin Cloud is the autonomous remote engineer (plans, codes, tests, opens PRs). Devin Desktop (formerly Windsurf, rebranded June 2026) is the local AI editor with the Agent Command Center, Spaces, and ACP support. Devin CLI brings the same agent into the terminal. All three share one Cognition account and the SWE-2 proprietary model, released September 10, 2026.","compare_clusters":["cursor","claude-code-cli","windsurf","replit-agent"],"official_links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://devin.ai"},{"label":"Devin Desktop (ex-Windsurf)","url":"https://devin.ai/desktop"},{"label":"Devin CLI","url":"https://devin.ai/cli"},{"label":"Devin Cloud","url":"https://devin.ai/cloud"},{"label":"Pricing","url":"https://devin.ai/pricing"},{"label":"Docs","url":"https://docs.devin.ai"},{"label":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devin_AI"}],"pricing":"Free $0 · Pro $20/mo · Max $200/mo · Teams $80/mo + $40/mo per full dev seat (up to 200 users) · Enterprise custom. Billed monthly only, no annual option. Paid plans carry a daily/weekly refreshing usage allowance; extra usage at API pricing.","usps":["Three surfaces: Devin Cloud (autonomous remote agent), Devin Desktop (local editor, ex-Windsurf), Devin CLI (terminal)","One Cognition account drives all three; Agent Command Center orchestrates from Desktop","SWE-2 proprietary model, free on paid plans in Desktop and CLI through October 16, 2026, plus Claude / GPT / Gemini / xAI frontier models","Devin Wiki auto-documents your codebase for faster onboarding and context sharing","API + ACP (Agent Coding Protocol) for embedding Devin into CI/CD and other editors"],"signup_url":"https://devin.ai","logo_url":"/images/tools/logos/devin-logo.png","hero_image":"/images/tools/heroes/devin-hero.jpg","votes":2394,"serpBoost":2,"dateModified":"2026-09-30","tags":["enterprise"],"seo_keywords":["devin ai review","devin autonomous coding agent","devin ai pricing 2026","ai software engineer","autonomous code generation","vibe coding agent"],"best_for_badges":["Autonomous Agent","End-to-End Tasks"],"special_features":[{"icon":"Bot","title":"Fully Autonomous Execution","description":"Devin plans, writes, tests, and deploys code end-to-end in a sandboxed environment; no hand-holding needed."},{"icon":"Terminal","title":"Sandboxed IDE + Shell","description":"Each task runs in an isolated environment with a full code editor, terminal, and browser for safe exploration and execution."},{"icon":"BookOpen","title":"Devin Wiki","description":"Auto-generated codebase documentation that helps Devin (and your team) understand the project context faster."}],"theme_colors":{"primary":"blue-600","secondary":"indigo-600","gradient":"from-blue-600 to-indigo-600"},"tweets":[{"id":"2027085000986824960","authorName":"0xMarioNawfal","authorHandle":"@RoundtableSpace","authorAvatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2012162102283407360/U-fPj6wg_400x400.jpg","content":"Devin 2.2 just dropped, it now tests its own work, catches the bugs, and fix